# stackguardian_connector (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Referencing a connector

Other resources refer to a connector by ID, in the form `/integrations/<resource_name>`:

- `deployment_platform_config.integration_id` on a workflow — the credentials it deploys with.
- `custom_source.config.auth` on any VCS-backed resource — how a private repository is cloned.

## Choosing a kind

`settings.kind` selects the connector type, and each kind requires a *different* subset of
`settings.config` fields. The `kind` documentation below lists the supported values together with
the fields each one needs. Check that list first if a connector is created but does not work.

